    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RE/MAX Property Specialists proudly present No. 3 Pleasant Drive, Mount Pleasant to the market.\r\n\r\nMount Pleasant is a well established mature residential development comprising an attractive mix of detached, semi-detached and bungalow-style homes.\r\n\r\nNo 3 is a superb four-bedroom, two-bathroom detached bungalow with an adjoining garage, enjoying a quiet and private setting surrounded by mature gardens to both the front and rear. \r\n\r\nA spacious driveway provides ample off-street parking, comfortably accommodating a number of cars.\r\nInternally, this beautiful home offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nThe front sitting room features an attractive cast-iron fireplace with marble hearth, while a separate cosy living room off the kitchen has a fitted Stanley stove, creating a warm and inviting space. The kitchen enjoys a pleasant outlook over the sunny patio, with the accommodation further comprising a utility area, WC, four generously sized double bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe mature gardens are a particularly appealing feature of the property, offering excellent privacy and providing attractive outdoor spaces for relaxing and family use.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with both Tesco and Ardkeen Shopping Centres, University Hospital Waterford and a wide range of schools, shops, cafés and everyday amenities all within easy reach. The area is also served by a regular bus service to Waterford City Centre.\r\n\r\nMount Pleasant is ideally positioned close to Waterford's Outer Ring Road, providing convenient access to SETU, the city's industrial estates, the N25 and M9 road network.\r\n\r\nThe property was built Circa. 1982, with oil-fired central heating, and a D energy rating.\r\n\r\nViewing of this spacious and well-located family home is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nThese particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. RE/MAX Property Specialists - Team fogarty will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein"
      },
